 if t==27:
  teach('6.1.1-01','A nuclide is a type of nucleus identified by its proton and neutron numbers, or equivalently A and Z. Relative charge/mass are proton +1/about 1, neutron 0/about 1 and electron −1/about 1/1840. A neutral atom has Z electrons.')
  d('6.1.1-01',prompt='Define a nuclide.',answer='A nuclide is a particular type of nucleus specified by its proton and neutron numbers, or by A and Z.')
